<title>PMII Comic Style</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bangers&family=Comic+Neue:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

/* BODY */

body{
font-family:'Comic Neue',sans-serif;

background:
radial-gradient(circle,#000 3px,transparent 3px),
#ffe600;

background-size:26px 26px;

color:#000;
transition:.4s;
}

body.dark{
background:
radial-gradient(circle,#fff 3px,transparent 3px),
#121212;
background-size:26px 26px;
color:#fff;
}

/* WRAPPER */

.pmi-wrapper{
width:100%;
max-width:1200px;
margin:60px auto;
padding:0 20px;
}

/* PANEL */

.pmi-section{

position:relative;

max-width:1000px;

margin:auto;

padding:100px 50px 70px;

background:#fff;

border:8px solid #000;

border-radius:20px;

box-shadow:12px 12px 0 #000;

line-height:1.9;

transition:.4s;

/* INI PENTING */
overflow:visible;

}

body.dark .pmi-section{
background:#1a1a1a;
border:8px solid #fff;
box-shadow:12px 12px 0 #fff;
}

/* ================= PMII TITLE ================= */

.comic-title{

position:absolute;

left:-120px;
top:-70px;

font-family:'Bangers',cursive;

font-size:110px;

color:#ff2e2e;

text-shadow:
6px 6px 0 #000,
10px 10px 0 #ffe600;

transform:rotate(-12deg);

z-index:999;

}

body.dark .comic-title{
color:#4da6ff;
}

/* JUDUL */

h1{

font-family:'Bangers';

font-size:42px;

letter-spacing:2px;

text-align:center;

margin-bottom:30px;

text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #000;

}

/* SPEECH */

.lead{

background:#fff;

border:6px solid #000;

border-radius:40px;

padding:40px;

max-width:860px;

margin:auto;

text-align:center;

font-size:20px;

font-weight:600;

position:relative;

box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #000;

}

body.dark .lead{
background:#222;
border:6px solid #fff;
box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #fff;
}

/* TAIL */

.lead:after{

content:"";

position:absolute;

bottom:-30px;
left:80px;

border-width:30px 30px 0;

border-style:solid;

border-color:#000 transparent transparent;

}

/* SWITCH */

.controls{

position:absolute;

right:20px;
top:20px;

}

.slider-wrap{

width:110px;
height:44px;

background:#ff3b3b;

border:5px solid #000;

border-radius:40px;

position:relative;

cursor:pointer;

box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #000;

}

.slider-btn{

width:36px;
height:36px;

background:#fff;

border-radius:50%;

position:absolute;

top:2px;
left:2px;

display:flex;

align-items:center;
justify-content:center;

font-size:18px;

border:4px solid #000;

transition:.35s;

}

.dark .slider-btn{
transform:translateX(62px);
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="pmi-wrapper">

<section class="pmi-section">

<div class="comic-title">PMII!</div>

<div class="controls">
<div id="toggleMode" class="slider-wrap">
<div class="slider-btn" id="toggleIcon">☀️</div>
</div>
</div>

<h1>PERGERAKAN MAHASISWA ISLAM INDONESIA</h1>

<p class="lead">

PMII merupakan organisasi gerakan dan kaderisasi yang berlandaskan nilai-nilai Islam Ahlussunnah wal Jama’ah. Berdiri pada 17 April 1960 di Surabaya, PMII hadir sebagai ruang intelektual, perjuangan sosial, serta pembentukan kader yang berintegritas.

Selama lebih dari setengah abad, PMII terus konsisten menjaga komitmen kebangsaan, memperkuat tradisi keilmuan, serta mendorong lahirnya generasi muda yang kritis, moderat, dan berakhlak.

</p>

</section>

</div>

<script>

const body=document.body;
const toggle=document.getElementById("toggleMode");
const icon=document.getElementById("toggleIcon");

let dark=false;

toggle.onclick=()=>{

dark=!dark;

body.classList.toggle("dark");

icon.textContent=dark?"🌙":"☀️";

};

</script>

</body>
