<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Portal Berita PMII STAIM Kendal - Tablet/HP</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root{
  --primary:#0f172a;
  --accent:#c2410c;
  --bg:#f1f5f9;
  --card:#ffffff;
  --muted:#64748b;
}

*{
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--primary);
}

.wrapper{
  max-width:1200px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:20px 15px;
}

/* ================= GRID TABLET & HP ================= */
.news-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr;
  gap:15px;
}

/* LABEL DAN IMAGE WRAPPER */
.label{
  position:absolute;
  top:8px;
  left:8px;
  background:var(--accent);
  color:#fff;
  font-size:10px;
  font-weight:600;
  padding:4px 10px;
  border-radius:20px;
  letter-spacing:1px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
  animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes float{
  0%{transform:translateY(0);}
  50%{transform:translateY(-3px);}
  100%{transform:translateY(0);}
}

.image-wrapper{
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  border-radius:16px;
}

.image-wrapper img{
  width:100%;
  object-fit:cover;
  transition:transform .5s ease;
}

.image-wrapper:hover img{
  transform:scale(1.05);
}

/* MAIN NEWS & SUB CARD KOTAK */
.main-news, .sub-card, .sidebar{
  background:var(--card);
  border-radius:16px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  opacity:0;
  transform:translateY(10px);
  transition:all .5s ease;
}

.main-news.active, .sub-card.active, .sidebar.active{
  opacity:1;
  transform:translateY(0);
}

/* MAIN NEWS Paling Atas - TINGGI 400px */
.main-news .image-wrapper img{
  height:400px; /* ditambah tinggi */
}

.main-news h1{
  font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
  font-size:18px;
  margin:10px 10px 5px;
}

.main-news p{
  font-size:13px;
  margin:0 10px 10px;
  color:var(--muted);
  line-height:1.5;
}

/* SUB NEWS KOTAK */
.sub-news{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));
  gap:10px;
}

.sub-card-content{
  padding:10px;
}

.sub-card-content h4{
  font-size:14px;
  margin-bottom:4px;
  line-height:1.3;
}

.sub-card-content p{
  font-size:12px;
  margin-bottom:4px;
  color:var(--muted);
}

.sub-card-content small{
  font-size:11px;
  color:var(--accent);
  font-weight:600;
}

/* SIDEBAR TABLET/HP */
.sidebar{
  padding:15px;
}

.sidebar h3{
  font-size:16px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  position:relative;
}

.sidebar h3::after{
  content:"";
  width:50px;
  height:3px;
  background:var(--accent);
  position:absolute;
  left:0;
  bottom:-8px;
  border-radius:10px;
}

.sidebar ul{
  list-style:none;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(120px,1fr));
  gap:10px;
}

.sidebar li a{
  display:block;
  text-decoration:none;
  color:inherit;
  font-size:12px;
}

.sidebar img{
  width:100%;
  height:80px;
  object-fit:cover;
  border-radius:12px;
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="news-grid">

    <!-- MAIN NEWS -->
    <div class="main-news">
      <div class="image-wrapper">
        <span class="label">Kaderisasi</span>
        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/ZzR3bLVj/bjsanmklshdugqehas.png" alt="Main News">
      </div>
      <h1>PK PMII STAIM Kendal Perkuat Gerakan Kaderisasi Strategis</h1>
      <p>Pengurus Komisariat PMII STAIM Kendal terus memperkuat konsolidasi organisasi melalui program kaderisasi berkelanjutan yang progresif dan berbasis intelektual.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- SUB NEWS -->
    <div class="sub-news">
      <div class="sub-card">
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <span class="label">Literasi</span>
          <img src="https://i.ibb.co/4nbQsgSc/Chat-GPT-Image-Jan-27-2026-02-10-16-PM.png" alt="Sub News">
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card-content">
          <h4>Program Sahabat Literasi Kader</h4>
          <p>Gerakan membaca & diskusi rutin memperkuat budaya akademik kader.</p>
          <small>08 Jan 2026</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sub-card">
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <span class="label">Pelantikan</span>
          <img src="https://assets.pikiran-rakyat.com/crop/0x1283:3000x3345/720x0/webp/photo/2026/01/24/3220267689.jpg" alt="Sub News">
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card-content">
