<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Professional Footer Rapi</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  background: #f1f1f1;
}

/* ===== FOOTER FULL BLEED ===== */
.full-footer {
  width: 100vw;
  margin-left: calc(-50vw + 50%);
  margin-right: calc(-50vw + 50%);
}

/* ===== FOOTER UTAMA ===== */
.footer {
  position: relative;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
  color: white;
  padding: 80px 10% 40px 10%;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Glow kiri & kanan */
.footer::before,
.footer::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  z-index: 1;
}

.footer::before {
  top: -120px;
  left: -120px;
  width: 350px;
  height: 350px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.2), transparent 70%);
}

.footer::after {
  bottom: -150px;
  right: -150px;
  width: 400px;
  height: 400px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 0, 200, 0.15), transparent 70%);
}

/* GRID */
.footer-container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 50px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

/* Footer Heading */
.footer h3 {
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  position: relative;
  text-align: center; /* pastikan teks center */
}

.footer h3::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -8px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 50px;
  height: 3px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00f5ff, #ff00c8);
  border-radius: 20px;
}

/* Links & Text */
.footer p,
.footer a {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  text-decoration: none;
  line-height: 1.8;
  transition: 0.3s ease;
}

.footer a:hover {
  color: #00f5ff;
  padding-left: 5px;
  display: inline-block;
  transition: 0.3s ease;
}

/* ===== BOTTOM BAR ===== */
.footer-bottom {
  margin-top: 70px;
  padding-top: 30px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  position: relative;
}

/* Setengah Lingkaran Dalam Bar */
.footer-bottom::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: -35px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 160px;
  height: 80px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f5ff, #ff00c8);
  border-top-left-radius: 160px;
  border-top-right-radius: 160px;
  opacity: 0.12;
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .footer {
    padding: 60px 8% 30px 8%;
  }
  .footer-container {
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .footer h3 {
    text-align: left;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="full-footer">
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-container">

      <div>
        <h3>Tentang Kami</h3>
        <p>Kami menyediakan layanan profesional dengan desain modern dan kualitas terbaik untuk kebutuhan digital Anda.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Layanan</h3>
        <p><a href="#">Web Development</a></p>
        <p><a href="#">UI/UX Design</a></p>
        <p><a href="#">Brand Identity</a></p>
        <p><a href="#">Digital Marketing</a></p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Kontak</h3>
        <p>Email: info@email.com</p>
        <p>Phone: +62 812 3456 7890</p>
        <p>Indonesia</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      © 2026 All Rights Reserved | Professional Modern Footer
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>

</body>
</html>
