</style>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"5217a97","elType":"container","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"dd917d9","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class="premium-news" style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; max-width:1100px; margin:auto; padding:50px; background:#f5f7fa; border-radius:16px; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

  <!-- Hero Image -->
  <div class="hero-image" style="position:relative; margin-bottom:50px;">
    <img src="https://i.ibb.co/wZbzLvbb/Whats-App-Image-2026-03-16-at-7-03-22-PM.jpg" 
         alt="Beasiswa LPPD Ngawi" 
         style="width:100%; border-radius:16px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">
    <h1 style="position:absolute; bottom:30px; left:30px; color:#fff; font-family:'Bangers',cursive; font-size:50px; text-shadow:4px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); max-width:90%;">

    </h1>
  </div>

  <!-- Meta Info -->
  <p style="text-align:center; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:10px;">NGAWI, 11 Maret 2026</p>
  <p style="text-align:center; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:40px;">Editor: Slamet Karisna</p>

  <!-- Konten utama -->
  <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:40px;">

    <!-- Kolom teks -->
    <div style="flex:1 1 600px; min-width:300px; line-height:1.8; color:#111827; font-size:16px;">

      <p>Kantor Kementerian Agama Kabupaten Ngawi menggelar sosialisasi program beasiswa bagi pondok pesantren dan madrasah diniyah se-Kabupaten Ngawi, Selasa (11/03/2026). Kegiatan ini dihadiri oleh perwakilan pondok pesantren, madrasah diniyah, serta Kader PMII Kabupaten Ngawi lintas komisariat. Kehadiran PMII merupakan bagian dari partisipasi organisasi dalam kegiatan pendidikan ini, bukan sebagai peliput. Sekretaris Lembaga Pengembangan Pesantren dan Diniyah (LPPD) Provinsi Jawa Timur, <strong>Prof. Dr. H. Muhibbin Zuhri, M.Ag.</strong>, hadir sebagai narasumber.</p>

      <p>Kepala Kantor Kementerian Agama Kabupaten Ngawi, <strong>Moh. Ersat</strong>, menyampaikan bahwa program beasiswa ini diharapkan membuka peluang yang lebih luas bagi para santri untuk melanjutkan pendidikan ke jenjang lebih tinggi, sekaligus mendukung peningkatan Indeks Pembangunan Manusia (IPM) di Kabupaten Ngawi.</p>

      <blockquote style="border-left:6px solid #1e3a8a; padding-left:20px; font-style:italic; color:#1e3a8a; margin:25px 0; font-size:17px; background:#e0f2fe; border-radius:8px; padding:20px;">
        “Di Ngawi terdapat banyak pondok pesantren dan madrasah diniyah dengan santri yang memiliki potensi luar biasa. Melalui beasiswa ini, mereka dapat mengembangkan diri dan meningkatkan kapasitas pendidikan.” – Moh. Ersat
      </blockquote>

      <p>Kepala Seksi Pendidikan Diniyah dan Pondok Pesantren Kemenag Ngawi, <strong>Mukibbudin</strong>, menambahkan bahwa minat para santri untuk melanjutkan pendidikan cukup tinggi. Oleh karena itu, program beasiswa menjadi kesempatan penting bagi mereka untuk memperluas kompetensi dan wawasan.</p>

      <p><strong>Prof. Dr. H. Muhibbin Zuhri</strong> menjelaskan aturan khusus untuk memperoleh Beasiswa LPPD. Pondok pesantren di Ngawi harus memiliki <strong>PDF (Pendidikan Diniyah Formal)</strong> dan program <strong>Mahaj Ali</strong> tersendiri. Beasiswa ini berlaku tidak hanya untuk prodi keagamaan, tetapi juga prodi non-agama seperti <strong>STEM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Mathematics)</strong>, termasuk teknologi dan rekayasa.</p>

      <p>Beliau menekankan bahwa bantuan beasiswa <strong>tidak berlaku untuk kampus yang memiliki pondok</strong>, tetapi berlaku bagi pondok yang memiliki kampus atau tempat kuliah, dan kedua entitas harus bisa dibedakan secara jelas. Selain itu, beliau memaparkan perbedaan mekanisme klaim bantuan di Kemenag bagi <strong>PTKI</strong> dan <strong>Mahaj Ali</strong>, agar pengelolaan dan pencairan beasiswa sesuai aturan.</p>

      <p>Prof. Muhibbin Zuhri juga menegaskan bahwa bantuan beasiswa hanya bisa diklaim oleh pondok pesantren yang sudah memiliki <strong>izin resmi atau terdaftar di Kemenag</strong>. Santri dari pesantren yang belum diakui atau belum memiliki izin belum dapat mengklaim beasiswa, sehingga legalitas pondok menjadi syarat utama.</p>

      <p>Dalam sosialisasi, beliau juga menyinggung soal penyalahgunaan beasiswa yang pernah terjadi, yang mengakibatkan putusnya kerja sama dengan beberapa universitas. Beliau menegaskan bahwa Beasiswa LPPD bersifat murni dan bebas biaya – dari masuk hingga memperoleh ijazah, santri tidak dipungut biaya sepeser pun (0 Rp). Kasus ini relevan dengan praktik beberapa bantuan dari Kemenag, di mana beberapa kampus di Kabupaten Ngawi mewajibkan mahasiswa membayar uang santunan atau biaya tambahan, meskipun seharusnya bantuan tersebut bebas biaya.</p>

      <p>Hadirnya Kader PMII dari seluruh komisariat di Ngawi menunjukkan kepedulian organisasi terhadap pengembangan pendidikan santri, sekaligus sebagai peserta aktif dalam sosialisasi ini.</p>

    </div>

    <!-- Kolom gambar -->
    <div style="flex:1 1 300px; min-width:250px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:25px;">

      <!-- Foto Narasumber -->
      <div style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:15px; box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); text-align:center; transition:transform 0.3s;">
        <img src="https://www.radar96.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-19-at-16.33.51_3097b56b.jpg" 
             alt="Prof. Muhibbin Zuhri" 
             style="width:100%; border-radius:50%; object-fit:cover; margin-bottom:10px; transition:transform 0.3s;">
        <h3 style="margin:0; font-size:18px; color:#1e3a8a;">Prof. Dr. H. Muhibbin Zuhri, M.Ag.</h3>
        <p style="margin:5px 0 0; font-size:14px; color:#6b7280;">Sekretaris LPPD Jatim</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Gambar Kegiatan -->
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200.png?text=Kegiatan+Sosialisasi" 
           alt="Kegiatan Sosialisasi" 
           style="width:100%; border-radius:12px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); transition:transform 0.3s;">
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div style="margin-top:50px; text-align:center;">
    <p style="color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:15px;">#BeasiswaLPPD #Ngawi #Santri #Pendidikan #PMII</p>
    <a href="#" style="text-decoration:none; padding:12px 30px; background:#1e3a8a; color:#fff; border-radius:10px; font-weight:600; display:inline-block; transition:background 0.3s;">Share Berita</a>
  </div>

</section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"291d53f","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column"},"elements":[{"id":"20e7be2","elType":"widget","settings":{"share_buttons":[{"_id":"012efa0"},{"button":"x-twitter","_id":"cf59ae8"},{"button":"whatsapp","_id":"a8d57b8"}]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"share-buttons"}],"isInner":false}]

[{"id":"018c32e","elType":"container","settings":{"hide_tablet":"hidden-tablet","hide_mobile":"hidden-mobile","hide_desktop":"hidden-desktop"},"elements":[{"id":"3673381","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kartu Idulfitri PMII</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500&family=Amiri&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
  min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  color:#fff;
  overflow:hidden;
  background:url('https://i.ibb.co/k69Rq50N/Chat-GPT-Image-Mar-20-2026-08-02-37-PM.png') center/cover no-repeat;
}

/* OVERLAY */
body::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(255,215,0,0.15), transparent 60%),
             radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, rgba(255,215,0,0.12), transparent 60%),
             rgba(10,15,30,0.8);
  backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  animation:ambientMove 10s linear infinite alternate;
}
@keyframes ambientMove{0%{filter:brightness(1);}100%{filter:brightness(1.2);}}

/* PARTICLE BINTANG */
.star{position:absolute;width:2px;height:2px;background:#ffd700;opacity:0.6;animation:twinkle 3s infinite;}
@keyframes twinkle{0%,100%{opacity:0.2;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.8);}}

/* WRAPPER */
.wrapper{perspective:1800px;position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}
.book{display:flex;position:relative;}

/* BORDER EMAS */
.stroke{position:relative;border-radius:20px;}
.stroke::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  padding:3px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ffd700,#fff3a0,#ffd700,#ffcc00,#ffd700);
  background-size:400%;
  animation:borderMove 5s linear infinite;
  -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
  -webkit-mask-composite:xor;
  mask-composite:exclude;
}
@keyframes borderMove{0%{background-position:0%}100%{background-position:400%}}

/* HALAMAN */
.page-right{
  width:350px; max-width:90vw;
  aspect-ratio:9/12;
  border-radius:20px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
}

/* FRAME DALAM */
.inner-frame{
  position:relative;
  width:100%;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:16px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,215,0,0.1);
  text-align:center;
}

/* SHIMMER TEXT */
.title{
  font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size:2rem;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFD700,#FFECB3,#FFD700);
  background-size:200%;
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
  animation:shine 3s linear infinite;
  letter-spacing:2px;
  text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,215,0,0.5);
}
@keyframes shine{0%{background-position:-200%}100%{background-position:200%;}}

/* CARD */
.card{
  width:350px; max-width:90vw;
  aspect-ratio:9/12;
  position:absolute; left:0;top:0;
  transform-style:preserve-3d;
  transform-origin:left;
  transition:transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.7,-0.2,.2,1);
  cursor:pointer;
  z-index:3;
  background:url('https://i.ibb.co/67dGjWYp/Chat-GPT-Image-Mar-21-2026-09-42-59-AM.png') center/cover no-repeat;
  border-radius:20px;
  box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
}
.card.open{
  transform:rotateY(-170deg) scale(0.98);
  box-shadow:0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
}

/* LOGO */
.logo{width:40%;max-width:120px;border-radius:50%;animation:logoFloat 4s ease-in-out infinite,glow 2s infinite alternate;}
@keyframes logoFloat{50%{transform:translateY(-10px);}}
@keyframes glow{0%{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px gold);}100%{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 20px gold);}}

/* TEXT */
.text{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px;color:rgba(255,245,220,0.95);opacity:0;animation:fadeUp 1s forwards;}
.text:nth-child(2){animation-delay:0.5s;}
.text:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1s;}
.text:nth-child(4){animation-delay:1.5s;}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

/* LOVE */
.love{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;font-size:1.2rem;color:gold;animation:loveFly 2s ease-out forwards;}
@keyframes loveFly{0%{opacity:1;transform:scale(0.5);}100%{opacity:0;transform:translate(var(--x),var(--y)) scale(2);}}

/* PROGRESS BAR */
.progress-bar{width:60%;height:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);border-radius:5px;margin-top:10px;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.3s;}
.progress-bar-inner{width:0%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFD700,#FFECB3,#FFD700);border-radius:5px;transition:width 2s ease-in-out;}

/* MEDIA QUERY */
@media(max-width:480px){
  .title{font-size:1.5rem;}
  .text{font-size:0.9rem;}
  .progress-bar{width:70%;}
  .logo{width:50px;}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<audio id="takbiran-sound" src="http://pmiikomiskenda.42web.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2023-BIKIN-RINDU-KAMPUNG-HALAMAN-1.mp3" preload="auto"></audio>

<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="book">

    <div class="page-right stroke">
      <div class="inner-frame">
        <div class="title">1447 H</div>
        <div class="text">Mohon Maaf Lahir dan Batin</div>
        <div class="text">Segenap keluarga besar PMII STAIM Kendal Ngawi mengucapkan <strong>Selamat Hari Raya Idulfitri</strong>.</div>
        <div class="text">Semoga kita kembali suci dan mempererat ukhuwah.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card stroke" id="card">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;">
        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/RG5Fypty/gsgsgsgs.png" class="logo">
        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/Rk6MyMYT/Chat-GPT-Image-Mar-21-2026-10-05-23-AM.png" style="width:60%;margin:10px 0;">
        <p>KLIK SAHABAT</p>
        <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-bar-inner"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<script>
const card = document.getElementById("card");
const progressBar = card.querySelector(".progress-bar");
const progressInner = card.querySelector(".progress-bar-inner");
const takbiranSound = document.getElementById("takbiran-sound");

card.onclick = () => {
  progressInner.style.width = "0%";
  progressBar.style.opacity = 1;
  setTimeout(()=>{ progressInner.style.width = "100%"; }, 50);

  setTimeout(()=>{
    card.classList.toggle("open");
    progressBar.style.opacity = 0;
    burstLove();
    takbiranSound.currentTime = 0;
    takbiranSound.play();
  }, 2000);
};

function burstLove(){
  const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();
  const cx = rect.left + rect.width/2;
  const cy = rect.top + rect.height/2;
  for(let i=0;i<60;i++){
    const el = document.createElement("div");
    el.className="love";
    el.innerHTML="❤";
    document.body.appendChild(el);

    el.style.left = cx+"px";
    el.style.top = cy+"px";
    const angle = Math.random()*2*Math.PI;
    const dist = 150 + Math.random()*300;
    el.style.setProperty("--x", Math.cos(angle)*dist+"px");
    el.style.setProperty("--y", Math.sin(angle)*dist+"px");
    setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),2000);
  }
}

for(let i=0;i<80;i++){
  const star = document.createElement("div");
  star.className="star";
  star.style.top = Math.random()*100+"%";
  star.style.left = Math.random()*100+"%";
  star.style.animationDuration=(2+Math.random()*3)+"s";
  document.body.appendChild(star);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>","hide_tablet":"hidden-tablet","hide_mobile":"hidden-mobile"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"83fc24a","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","hide_tablet":"hidden-tablet"},"elements":[{"id":"0b9cb32","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kartu Idulfitri</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html, body {
  height: 100%;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}

/* BACKGROUND */
body {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
}

/* CARD */
.card {
  width: 340px;
  height: 220px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1e293b, #0f172a);
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: scale(1.03);
}

.card h2 {
  color: gold;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  text-align: center;
}

/* OVERLAY UCAPAN */
.overlay {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #020617, #000);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: 0.5s;
}

.overlay.active {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: all;
}

.overlay h1 {
  color: gold;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

/* 🔥 WARNING TRANSPARAN */
.warning {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: none;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;

  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

  z-index: 9999;
}

.warning.active {
  display: flex;
}

/* BOX */
.warning-box {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 25px;
  max-width: 360px;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}

.warning h1 {
  color: gold;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

.warning p {
  opacity: 0.9;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- WARNING -->
<div class="warning" id="warning">
  <div class="warning-box">
    <h1>⚠️ Perhatian</h1>
    <p>
      Website ini hanya dapat dibuka menggunakan <b>smartphone (HP)</b>.<br><br>
      Jika Anda membuka dari laptop/komputer, silakan gunakan smartphone<br>
      Dan aktifkan <b>Mode Desktop/Situs DEkstop</b> di browser Anda.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CARD -->
<div class="card" onclick="openCard()">
  <h2>Klik untuk Membuka ✨</h2>
</div>

<!-- OVERLAY -->
<div class="overlay" id="overlay">
  <h1>Selamat Idulfitri</h1>
